{"step_index":440,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-07T02:00:17Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-07T11:00:17+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-07T11:00:20+09:00\nThe search for \"\"주식회사 강봉천흡선\" OR \"(주)강봉천흡선\"\" returned the following summary:\n(주)강봉천흡선은 부산광역시 중구 중앙동6가에 소재한 통신판매업체로 확인됩니다[1]. 해당 기업은 식품 관련 업체 목록 등에서 언급된 바 있습니다[2].\n\nSources:\n[1] [bsjunggu.go.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGzExTr53XuHmEPnYSkSyfu5gnvZ4qW9-roVGJHwwfPb_s11VNX0l_6kH8j3_zGebiF0TWMjf6iYjFisllFLNFI_6iuRHaKad2TTmIc5E0HTdkKZwKIkh5eXnv1WfOOz1iklWAKzSzsi-15YfmIQvuqJJw62X4fN2PjjSJDUe_VdjuDFqEKnIqgw7ds38grgbD3Fj9LPkvOh3Vo2O-FTC4fpxktXoLC_YUin6i5McdAIP7FQVxs0KWOKn5DX5zJrmtI8H1kNEysncC_c3p6d5R_1eyZjxlK-_ekfjxdIgGq03v9Xe_uj2Zmz4h5c46fxH-7VRv6Lb0ZDsMHS5keOYsLq00qv_k6dtLUs4Qqdfq2gIlAOiAsB9MKNDd1ZJn9xvv0hOCWPa0=)\n[2] [tistory.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFsLTHDYLCazVI6bk1TSGnVRqHHyyVtioEdoLOyh-FpEoLcN8BGwwatsYa_8zROQ2WjmNhp_FdSqdVl2mkHMaURpAJXJu2B1orfCat7muKqrcyP04_IJ1Q_fs5Ohw==)"}
